{"id":"n69230-1-8","stage":5,"title":"용례 · 例子","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69230-1-8-1","ko":"이렇게 어려운 단어를 외국인에게 가르칠 필요가 있을까?","zh":"真的有必要把这么难的单词教给外国人吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어려운","meaning":"难懂，难解","explanation":"어렵다：难懂，难解；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"어렵다","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62232","senseId":"3","lemma":"어렵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"단어를","meaning":"单词，词汇","explanation":"단어：单词，词汇；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"단어","audio":"/audio/bc97e79178e9c6075345.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57287","senseId":"1","lemma":"단어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"외국인에게","meaning":"外国人","explanation":"외국인：外国人；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"외국인","audio":"/audio/82d761d8dbb723689c37.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26210","senseId":"1","lemma":"외국인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가르칠","meaning":"教，教授，传授","explanation":"가르치다：教，教授，传授；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"가르치다","audio":"/audio/b630a8848339bddb2b9f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62255","senseId":"1","lemma":"가르치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"필요가","meaning":"必要，需要","explanation":"필요：必要，需要；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"필요","audio":"/audio/3ceb8b2c14a13750c453.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72405","senseId":"1","lemma":"필요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있을까?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"55d0f08434308816","term":"어렵다","zh":"难懂，难解","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3","entryId":"62232","definition":"言语或文章不容易理解。","pronunciation":["어렵따"]},{"id":"bc97e79178e9c607","term":"단어","zh":"单词，词汇","audio":"/audio/bc97e79178e9c6075345.mp3","entryId":"57287","definition":"具有一定的意义和功能、可单独被使用的最小的语言单位。","pronunciation":["다너"]},{"id":"82d761d8dbb72368","term":"외국인","zh":"外国人","audio":"/audio/82d761d8dbb723689c37.mp3","entryId":"26210","definition":"其他国家的人。","pronunciation":["외ː구긴","웨ː구긴"]},{"id":"b630a8848339bddb","term":"가르치다","zh":"教，教授，传授","audio":"/audio/b630a8848339bddb2b9f.mp3","entryId":"62255","definition":"说明知识或技术等，使熟知。","pronunciation":["가르치다"]},{"id":"3ceb8b2c14a13750","term":"필요","zh":"必要，需要","audio":"/audio/3ceb8b2c14a13750c453.mp3","entryId":"72405","definition":"必须得有。","pronunciation":["피료"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/290470f06a6a9b56e88f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69230-1-8-2","ko":"용례도 얼마 없으니 안 가르쳐도 될 것 같아.","zh":"反正例句也少，我觉得没必要教吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"용례도","meaning":"例子，例句","explanation":"용례：例子，例句；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"용례","audio":"/audio/f6ae7cc4a1d6ad07e085.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69230","senseId":"1","lemma":"용례","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼마","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마：多少","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없으니","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"2","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가르쳐도","meaning":"教，教授，传授","explanation":"가르치다：教，教授，传授；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"가르치다","audio":"/audio/b630a8848339bddb2b9f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62255","senseId":"1","lemma":"가르치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"될","meaning":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","explanation":"되다：可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"19","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f6ae7cc4a1d6ad07","term":"용례","zh":"例子，例句","audio":"/audio/f6ae7cc4a1d6ad07e085.mp3","entryId":"69230","definition":"实际使用的例子。","pronunciation":["용ː녜"]},{"id":"8e0a4529e0c9d4ed","term":"얼마","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3","entryId":"29750","definition":"不知道的数量、价值、程度。","pronunciation":["얼마"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"某个事实或现象在现实里不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"b630a8848339bddb","term":"가르치다","zh":"教，教授，传授","audio":"/audio/b630a8848339bddb2b9f.mp3","entryId":"62255","definition":"说明知识或技术等，使熟知。","pronunciation":["가르치다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/f791e04a3ef50b797f06.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.537,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69230","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":171,"sequenceScore":3.3637,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["反正例句也少，我觉得没必要教吧。","真的有必要把这么难的单词教给外国人吗？","那几个男生到底在聊什么啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["真的有必要把这么难的单词教给外国人吗？","那几个男生到底在聊什么啊？","反正例句也少，我觉得没必要教吧。"],"answer":2}]}
